{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/library_hero_3840x1200.png?t=1744277655\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Keeper of the Enchanted Books who enters the world of books. Traverse arcane dungeons, purge them of monsters with a magic pen, and leap into the well to plunge even deeper into hidden depths bound by forgotten spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1744277655\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a magic pen with found scrolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine scrolls found in the books to create a magic gun as you descend deeper into the well. Create a single, devastating projectile unleashing immense destruction in a single strike or trigger a chain of projectiles one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/Scrolls.gif?t=1744277655\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play. Improve. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a unique experience. Unlock new scrolls and discover powerful combinations and synergies that best suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a magic gun using powerful spell combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels provide an unique experience every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight ink monsters and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of scrolls and items to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn combat system</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2140310?t=1744277655","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/9c7318e5873b8807337bc70329e28c13a800bf64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744277655","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/0c2c6ce0bb60e25a42f0998709828b8b96c965da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744277655","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/0c2c6ce0bb60e25a42f0998709828b8b96c965da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744277655","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/library_hero_3840x1200.png?t=1744277655\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Keeper of the Enchanted Books who enters the world of books. Traverse arcane dungeons, purge them of monsters with a magic pen, and leap into the well to plunge even deeper into hidden depths bound by forgotten spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1744277655\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a magic pen with found scrolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine scrolls found in the books to create a magic gun as you descend deeper into the well. Create a single, devastating projectile unleashing immense destruction in a single strike or trigger a chain of projectiles one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/Scrolls.gif?t=1744277655\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play. Improve. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a unique experience. Unlock new scrolls and discover powerful combinations and synergies that best suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a magic gun using powerful spell combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels provide an unique experience every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight ink monsters and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of scrolls and items to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn combat system</p></li></ul>","developers":["Starrow Castles"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/4aaef16d00594ad7ff680cf298363a843ffe8033/header.jpg?t=1744277655","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257094413,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094413/movie480.mp4?t=1738601102","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094413/movie_max.mp4?t=1738601102"},"name":"Wish Me Well - Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257094413/ec87a1f8ac62f41fa9ca64d12fd74bbf0b24231f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738601102","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094413/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738601102","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257094413/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1738601102"}}],"name":"Wish Me Well","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Starrow Castles"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descri